<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo sets 150 million mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo sets 150 million mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Bank AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK HANNOVER </p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN DEM   COUPON     *3.75     MATURITY    20.JAN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    13.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING    HANNOVER  DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO 20.JAN.97 THEN STEPS UP TO 4.90 THEREAFTER</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 682</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
